          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "You are greeted by a gentle breeze and the scent of freshly picked flowers as you check in."
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Many dream of hotels as a home. For this collection, Albero presents an escape that still feels like home."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Inspired by a boutique stay, it offers a glimpse of what it might be like if Albero had its own hotel"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": ":a space that makes you look forward to coming over, yet feels lived in, as if you’ve always owned it."
            }
